2. Minimum Requirements: -
(i)
Sheekakai powder shall be.
(a)
clean, well dried and free from lumps;
(b)
uniform in colour;
(c)
free of any visible foreign matter;
(d)
free from insect infestations, live insect, dead insects; insect fragments, mould, mites, larvae, rodent hair and excreta;
(e)
free from fermented and musty odors;
(f)
free from dirt, extraneous matter like added colouring matter and other type of adulterants;
(g)
free from fungal growth.
